# BREADOS

## Intelligent Home Bread-Making Appliance

### Pure Julia — Appliance Control Engine

```julia
module BreadOS

using Dates
using Printf
using Statistics


# ============================================================
#
#                         BREADOS
#
#       INTELLIGENT HOME BREAD-MAKING APPLIANCE
#
# ============================================================
#
# BreadOS is an appliance-control and process-simulation engine
# for an automated bread machine.
#
# It models:
#
#   1. Ingredient loading
#   2. Ingredient equilibration
#   3. Kneading
#   4. Dough development
#   5. Bulk fermentation
#   6. Degassing / shaping
#   7. Final proof
#   8. Baking
#   9. Cooling
#  10. Completion
#
# Hardware abstraction:
#
#   - Temperature sensor
#   - Heater
#   - Motor
#   - Lid sensor
#   - Dough sensor
#   - Current sensor
#   - Fan
#   - Buzzer
#
# Control architecture:
#
#                 RECIPE
#                    │
#                    ▼
#              PROCESS ENGINE
#                    │
#       ┌────────────┼────────────┐
#       │            │            │
#   TEMPERATURE     MOTOR       SAFETY
#       │            │            │
#       └────────────┼────────────┘
#                    │
#                 TELEMETRY
#                    │
#                    ▼
#               BREAD PRODUCT
#
# This is a control-system simulation.
#
# Real hardware must use independent hardware safety systems,
# rated heaters, thermal cut-outs, motor protection and validated
# food-contact components.
#
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# ENUMERATIONS
# ============================================================

@enum BreadState begin

    IDLE

    LOADING

    PREHEAT

    AUTOLYSE

    KNEADING

    REST

    BULK_FERMENTATION

    PUNCH_DOWN

    SHAPING

    FINAL_PROOF

    BAKING

    CRUST_FINISH

    COOLING

    COMPLETE

    CLEANING

    FAULT

    EMERGENCY_STOP

end


@enum DoughPhase begin

    DOUGH_EMPTY

    DOUGH_MIXING

    DOUGH_DEVELOPMENT

    DOUGH_RISING

    DOUGH_PROOFING

    DOUGH_BAKING

    BREAD_FINISHED

end


